1
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,740
[Episode 28]

2
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:39,288
[Baijiang Airlines: Your flight is scheduled
to depart from Jiang City Airport.]

3
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:46,680
Looks like I can't stay here and run my shop.

4
00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:51,340
I should go back and enjoy the returns
on my long-term investment.

5
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:56,241
The Ferris wheel really is prettier at night.

6
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,700
Yeah.

7
00:02:04,246 --> 00:02:06,746
So, did you kiss her?

8
00:02:09,917 --> 00:02:11,597
Linda.

9
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:17,468
If you hadn't brought it up,
I'd have forgotten all about it.

10
00:02:17,468 --> 00:02:20,469
But all three of us saw it.

11
00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:25,640
Isn't this jealousy coming a little late?

12
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:28,260
You're not answering my question.

13
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:32,740
No. How could I possibly kiss her?

14
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:44,821
What?

15
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,140
Close your eyes.

16
00:03:25,980 --> 00:03:27,661
Do you like it?

17
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:31,140
When did you buy this?

18
00:03:31,140 --> 00:03:32,821
I'm not telling you.

19
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,040
Don't be scared.

20
00:03:40,969 --> 00:03:43,229
I'll always be right here with you.

21
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,958
Whether it's Teng City,

22
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,280
Hai City,

23
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:52,420
or anywhere else.

24
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:18,220
You're not going back to Haoyun today?

25
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:21,660
No. I haven't had enough rest yet.

26
00:05:21,660 --> 00:05:24,180
How long are you going to rest?

27
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:26,720
I don't know. I could just keep resting.

28
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,680
And never return?

29
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:32,260
Yeah. What?

30
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:35,780
You wouldn't look down on a househusband,
would you?

31
00:05:40,620 --> 00:05:42,700
Get home safe.

32
00:06:01,940 --> 00:06:03,620
- Hello?
<i>- Chen Yi.</i>

33
00:06:03,620 --> 00:06:07,959
<i>You ruined Mr. Zhai,
and you still get to live this comfortably.</i>

34
00:06:07,959 --> 00:06:11,260
<i>I'll get revenge for Mr. Zhai.</i>

35
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:18,899
- Okay, Coach.
- Okay, bye.

36
00:06:18,899 --> 00:06:20,399
Okay, everyone, watch closely.

37
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:23,279
Aim the cue at the cue ball like this.

38
00:06:23,279 --> 00:06:26,339
Then note where the cue ball lines up
with the target ball.

39
00:06:26,339 --> 00:06:27,500
Like this.

40
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:30,540
Here, bring the cue a little this way.

41
00:06:30,540 --> 00:06:32,540
Aim in a straight line.

42
00:06:32,540 --> 00:06:34,360
Good. Hit it with that much force.

43
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,660
It'll hit that ball.

44
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:37,220
But whatever you do, don't touch that ball.

45
00:06:37,220 --> 00:06:38,699
Yi, what's wrong?

46
00:06:38,699 --> 00:06:40,580
Is the pool hall okay?

47
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:45,480
It's fine. Everything's quiet.

48
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,940
<i>No one would dare mess with us now.</i>

49
00:06:46,940 --> 00:06:49,680
All of you, keep an eye out.
I'll be there soon.

50
00:07:05,380 --> 00:07:06,920
Liu.

51
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,000
Come outside with me.

52
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,819
- Jiang, watch the shop.
- Okay.

53
00:07:10,819 --> 00:07:13,000
- What's wrong?
- Let's go over there.

54
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:18,079
How did it start raining so soon?

55
00:07:18,079 --> 00:07:20,000
This weather...

56
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:25,881
Let's go take a look over there.

57
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:49,637
[Liquidation Audit]
[Capital Verification Report]

58
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:54,620
Stop shaking.

59
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:58,060
Look at this data chain of yours.
It's a mess, and you're still showing off?

60
00:08:09,162 --> 00:08:10,823
Jing.

61
00:08:14,660 --> 00:08:17,780
Redo the bad output from earlier.

62
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:22,960
Jing, you're finally back.

63
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,120
You have no idea.

64
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:28,360
When you were gone, I could only eat
in the cafeteria with that guy.

65
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,320
He talks so much. It's exhausting.

66
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,369
What do you mean?

67
00:08:32,369 --> 00:08:33,840
Cen doesn't have anyone to eat with either.

68
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:37,279
You could ask Cen to eat with you.
He doesn't talk much.

69
00:08:37,279 --> 00:08:42,420
Please. Nobody normal
eats with their boss after work.

70
00:08:42,420 --> 00:08:46,614
I'd end up malnourished, right?

71
00:08:46,614 --> 00:08:48,840
Enough. Help Ma Yang check the data.

72
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:51,280
I still have a bunch of emails to answer.

73
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:54,900
You really are a workaholic.

74
00:08:57,800 --> 00:09:02,460
[Let me know when you're home.]

75
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,980
Ma Yang.

76
00:09:10,340 --> 00:09:13,400
Then get me...

77
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:16,500
Get this data.

78
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:17,740
Have you looked at this?

79
00:09:17,740 --> 00:09:19,260
Yes.

80
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:26,860
Jing, I sent you the checked version.

81
00:09:26,860 --> 00:09:29,280
Look it over, okay?

82
00:09:34,060 --> 00:09:35,259
Hello.

83
00:09:35,259 --> 00:09:39,380
<i>Miao Jing, the pool hall is on fire.
Yi ran inside.</i>

84
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:45,560
<i>Miao...</i>

85
00:09:59,659 --> 00:10:02,380
Please go faster.

86
00:10:18,332 --> 00:10:20,000
<i>Breaking news.</i>

87
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:24,220
<i>Early this morning, a fire broke out
at a special task force site in our city.</i>

88
00:10:24,220 --> 00:10:28,200
<i>City fire and rescue crews have been sent
to fight the blaze.</i>

89
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,580
<i>Casualties are still being confirmed.</i>

90
00:10:30,580 --> 00:10:34,120
<i>Stay tuned for further updates.</i>

91
00:10:43,794 --> 00:10:45,317
[Diagonal Billiards Club]

92
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:49,040
Come out!

93
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:07,400
- Where's Chen Yi?
- There are students inside.

94
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:09,200
He ran in.

95
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,559
- Chen Yi!
- It's too dangerous.

96
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:12,399
- Chen Yi is still inside!
- I know.

97
00:11:12,399 --> 00:11:13,899
Make way.

98
00:11:13,899 --> 00:11:15,539
- Where's Chen Yi?
- He's still inside.

99
00:11:15,539 --> 00:11:17,740
- I'm going in to find him.
- Miao Jing! Miao Jing!

100
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:19,200
Miao Jing, move.

101
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,379
Get water!

102
00:11:20,379 --> 00:11:21,980
Everyone, please disperse.

103
00:11:21,980 --> 00:11:24,139
- Everyone, make way.
- Come on, everyone, stand back.

104
00:11:24,139 --> 00:11:25,179
- Uncle Zhou!
- Make way, everyone.

105
00:11:25,179 --> 00:11:26,399
- Uncle Zhou!
- Make way.

106
00:11:26,399 --> 00:11:27,659
- Make way, everyone.
- Save Chen Yi!

107
00:11:27,659 --> 00:11:29,220
- Chen Yi is still inside!
- I know!

108
00:11:29,220 --> 00:11:30,600
- Okay, just cooperate for now.
- Wait for the fire brigade.

109
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,879
- Wait for the fire brigade.
- Step back. Don't panic.

110
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:33,419
- Back up.
- Don't panic, everyone.

111
00:11:33,419 --> 00:11:34,639
- Back up.
- Make way.

112
00:11:34,639 --> 00:11:35,700
Please cooperate.

113
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:37,259
- Come on, make way.
- Step back a bit.

114
00:11:37,259 --> 00:11:38,340
- Step back a bit.
- Hurry!

115
00:11:38,340 --> 00:11:39,879
Hurry!

116
00:11:39,879 --> 00:11:41,320
- Calm down first.
- Hurry up!

117
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,440
You must calm down first.

118
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:46,960
Don't panic.

119
00:11:50,500 --> 00:11:52,800
This time is different.

120
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:20,280
Mr. Zhai?

121
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:21,980
Why are you here?

122
00:12:21,980 --> 00:12:24,000
Where's Zhang Bin?

123
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,860
He only said he needed extra hands.

124
00:12:26,860 --> 00:12:28,541
I don't know anything else.

125
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:47,720
For something like this, you don't show up,
and you send an outsider instead?

126
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:50,600
<i>The police came to the office again.</i>

127
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:52,300
Someone has to deal with them.

128
00:12:52,300 --> 00:12:56,800
If neither of us is there,
it'll look suspicious.

129
00:12:56,800 --> 00:13:00,639
<i>Don't worry. I'll handle Kuangxia.</i>

130
00:13:00,639 --> 00:13:04,330
As for Yi, you know him. He's one of us.

131
00:13:04,330 --> 00:13:05,640
<i>Got to go. They're back.</i>

132
00:13:05,640 --> 00:13:07,540
When you're done, hurry--

133
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:24,580
You stay here. Call me if anyone shows up.

134
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:36,120
Take what happened today to your grave.

135
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,700
Got it.

136
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:50,100
Wen Jie. Are you really not
coming with us for chicken hot pot?

137
00:13:50,100 --> 00:13:51,700
I'll pass. You guys go.

138
00:13:51,700 --> 00:13:53,960
- Okay.
- Go on then. It's really delicious.

139
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:57,980
- You go. I'll watch the place for you.
- Then we should eat extra.

140
00:13:57,980 --> 00:14:00,519
- Wen Jie, we're leaving.
- Okay. Bye.

141
00:14:00,519 --> 00:14:03,399
That place I told you about is amazing.

142
00:14:03,399 --> 00:14:06,200
And we can order three dishes.

143
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:02,900
Uncle Zhou, it's me.

144
00:15:02,900 --> 00:15:04,460
Get some people to Hongzhi Second Road now.

145
00:15:04,460 --> 00:15:06,420
The small building at the T-junction
on the south end.

146
00:15:06,420 --> 00:15:09,340
The one where Wen was transferred to work.

147
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:04,860
Uncle Zhou, there is a fire!

148
00:16:22,399 --> 00:16:24,020
Wen.

149
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:26,880
Wen.

150
00:16:27,740 --> 00:16:28,860
Yi.

151
00:16:28,860 --> 00:16:30,440
Wen.

152
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:34,240
Wen.

153
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,580
Wen.

154
00:16:35,580 --> 00:16:37,080
Wen.

155
00:16:37,779 --> 00:16:39,260
Go.

156
00:16:42,419 --> 00:16:44,639
The files.

157
00:16:44,639 --> 00:16:46,480
The files.

158
00:16:47,539 --> 00:16:49,120
Go.

159
00:16:51,539 --> 00:16:52,940
Yi.

160
00:16:52,940 --> 00:16:54,720
Yi.

161
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:57,240
The files are important.

162
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,559
Hide them.

163
00:16:58,559 --> 00:17:00,080
Not yet.

164
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,980
- Don't worry about me yet.
- Wen. Wen.

165
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,980
Hide them in the water tank.

166
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:09,801
Wait for me.

167
00:17:20,718 --> 00:17:22,983
[Evidence in the Kuangxia Real Estate
Tax Evasion Case]

168
00:17:32,768 --> 00:17:34,389
Wen!

169
00:17:35,599 --> 00:17:37,260
Wen!

170
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:29,905
Open the door.

171
00:18:29,905 --> 00:18:31,240
Chen Yi is inside!

172
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:33,260
Open the door!

173
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:36,819
Save him!

174
00:18:36,819 --> 00:18:39,020
Get him out.

175
00:18:39,579 --> 00:18:42,040
Miss, call the police.

176
00:18:42,876 --> 00:18:45,320
Uncle Liu, open the door.

177
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:48,579
- Chen Yi is inside. Hurry!
- Miss, listen to me.

178
00:18:48,579 --> 00:18:50,059
It's not that I don't want to help.

179
00:18:50,059 --> 00:18:52,299
The fire is too big. Going in is suicide.

180
00:18:52,299 --> 00:18:54,320
Just unlock it. You don't have to go in.

181
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:55,960
The inspection team's files are in there.

182
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,259
The inspection team?

183
00:18:57,259 --> 00:19:00,019
Aren't those files about a pyramid scheme?

184
00:19:00,019 --> 00:19:02,500
Okay.

185
00:19:03,060 --> 00:19:05,360
March 15, 2002.

186
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:06,840
Chen Zhi Yuan.

187
00:19:06,840 --> 00:19:08,900
Invested 50,000 yuan.

188
00:19:10,119 --> 00:19:12,000
April 1.

189
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,520
Liu Hui Min.

190
00:19:13,520 --> 00:19:15,839
Invested 80,000 yuan.

191
00:19:15,839 --> 00:19:17,840
May 15.

192
00:19:17,840 --> 00:19:19,620
Liu Guo Qiang.

193
00:19:19,620 --> 00:19:21,900
Invested 180,000 yuan.

194
00:19:23,460 --> 00:19:25,840
July 4.

195
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:27,680
Mo Fei.

196
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,940
Invested 300,000 yuan.

197
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:34,800
You think all this evidence will burn to ash?

198
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:38,799
The statute of limitations hasn't run out.

199
00:19:38,799 --> 00:19:43,500
If anything happens to Chen Yi in there today,
none of you gets off easy.

200
00:19:55,940 --> 00:19:58,180
Everyone, clear out.

201
00:19:59,140 --> 00:20:01,480
- Step back!
- Move back, move back!

202
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:02,799
Clear out, now.

203
00:20:02,799 --> 00:20:04,339
- Hurry! Set up the cordon!
- Hurry!

204
00:20:04,339 --> 00:20:06,460
- Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!
- Move along, please! Disperse!

205
00:20:06,460 --> 00:20:07,680
- This way! Move along!
- Hurry, hurry, hurry!

206
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:08,720
Thank you.

207
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:10,599
- Hurry up!
- Please cooperate with us!

208
00:20:10,599 --> 00:20:13,099
- Move back! Move back!
- Jing!

209
00:20:13,099 --> 00:20:15,819
- Uncle Zhou, Chen Yi is inside!
- Go!

210
00:20:15,819 --> 00:20:17,319
Uncle Zhou, Chen Yi is inside.

211
00:20:17,319 --> 00:20:18,759
- Jing, come here. Listen to me.
- Go and get him out!

212
00:20:18,759 --> 00:20:20,160
- Don't be reckless.
- Uncle Zhou!

213
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:22,000
Jing, come here.

214
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:23,819
Listen to me. Calm down.

215
00:20:23,819 --> 00:20:25,680
- Chen Yi is still inside!
- Leave it to the police.

216
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:28,299
Leave it to the police. Calm down.

217
00:20:42,019 --> 00:20:43,819
Go, move!

218
00:20:43,819 --> 00:20:45,519
- Hurry!
- Chen Yi!

219
00:20:45,519 --> 00:20:46,859
- Chen Yi!
- Jing, calm down! Jing!

220
00:20:46,859 --> 00:20:49,400
- I have to save him!
- Calm down, Jing.

221
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:51,460
- Calm down.
- Chen Yi!

222
00:20:51,460 --> 00:20:53,400
Calm down, Jing.

223
00:21:22,059 --> 00:21:24,220
Where is his family? Come here.

224
00:21:24,220 --> 00:21:26,799
Chen Yi.

225
00:21:26,799 --> 00:21:28,720
- Chen Yi!
- Chen Yi.

226
00:21:33,619 --> 00:21:35,320
Chen Yi.

227
00:22:27,259 --> 00:22:29,140
Wen.

228
00:22:29,140 --> 00:22:31,840
Wen.

229
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:54,720
Hello?

230
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:56,620
We just got out of the fire.

231
00:22:56,620 --> 00:22:58,619
The patient is a young man.

232
00:22:58,619 --> 00:23:02,799
Minor burns, possible smoke inhalation,
and acute lung injury.

233
00:23:02,799 --> 00:23:05,280
His vitals are stable for now.

234
00:23:05,900 --> 00:23:07,839
Chen Yi.

235
00:23:07,839 --> 00:23:10,340
Chen Yi, wake up.

236
00:23:13,119 --> 00:23:15,800
My college entrance exam score came out today.

237
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:17,600
640.

238
00:23:17,600 --> 00:23:19,760
I applied to the teachers' college here.

239
00:23:19,760 --> 00:23:22,720
I'm staying in Teng City with you.

240
00:23:24,099 --> 00:23:27,000
You said you'd check my score with me.

241
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,107
Get up.

242
00:23:29,799 --> 00:23:32,560
Wake up, Chen Yi.

243
00:23:38,599 --> 00:23:39,951
Chen Yi.

244
00:23:40,619 --> 00:23:43,740
Chen Yi!

245
00:23:44,500 --> 00:23:46,539
Chen Yi.

246
00:23:46,539 --> 00:23:49,100
- Chen Yi!
- Miao Jing, I'm here!

247
00:23:50,860 --> 00:23:52,700
Chen Yi.

248
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:03,120
- Chen Yi!
- Miao Jing, don't touch it.

249
00:24:04,140 --> 00:24:05,920
Don't touch it.

250
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:09,359
Is the child okay?

251
00:24:09,359 --> 00:24:11,600
- The child--
- The child is hurt.

252
00:24:11,600 --> 00:24:13,280
Careful.

253
00:24:17,320 --> 00:24:18,680
Are you okay?

254
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:20,540
I'm fine.

255
00:24:21,299 --> 00:24:23,299
Are you hurt? Come with me.

256
00:24:23,299 --> 00:24:25,240
Keep moving forward.

257
00:25:08,839 --> 00:25:10,980
Why are you looking at me like that?

258
00:25:18,740 --> 00:25:19,799
That hurts.

259
00:25:19,799 --> 00:25:21,079
My hand.

260
00:25:21,079 --> 00:25:22,860
My hand hurts.

261
00:25:24,760 --> 00:25:27,380
You scared me to death, you know that?

262
00:25:59,980 --> 00:26:02,700
Looks like it's nothing serious.

263
00:26:02,700 --> 00:26:04,960
You're in pretty good spirits.

264
00:26:06,158 --> 00:26:08,279
Hot roast goose.

265
00:26:11,100 --> 00:26:13,400
I need to ask you a few questions.

266
00:26:14,620 --> 00:26:15,920
Jing.

267
00:26:15,920 --> 00:26:17,820
Get me a glass of water.

268
00:26:21,989 --> 00:26:23,299
Go on.

269
00:26:23,299 --> 00:26:25,240
He's not going to eat me.

270
00:26:38,560 --> 00:26:40,480
Be honest with me.

271
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:43,420
How did you get yourself hurt again?

272
00:27:04,247 --> 00:27:06,119
The doctor says you need monitoring
for three more days.

273
00:27:06,119 --> 00:27:08,020
Don't take this lightly.

274
00:27:08,020 --> 00:27:12,440
If you keep messing up that arm,
you'll feel it every time it rains.

275
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:14,320
It's not that serious.

276
00:27:14,819 --> 00:27:18,420
- Here.
- You're still injured. You can't eat this.

277
00:27:22,640 --> 00:27:24,040
I can look, but I can't eat?

278
00:27:24,040 --> 00:27:26,000
Here, Uncle Zhou.

279
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:29,700
Listen to her.

280
00:27:29,700 --> 00:27:32,240
Don't take it for granted.

281
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:34,500
Take care of yourself. I'm leaving.

282
00:27:37,840 --> 00:27:40,880
You can't eat it, but I can. I'm taking it.

283
00:27:40,880 --> 00:27:42,360
Wait.

284
00:27:47,180 --> 00:27:49,640
This is all you can have.

285
00:27:52,600 --> 00:27:56,820
[Inpatient Department]

286
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:01,360
Now that he's awake, he's out of danger.

287
00:28:01,360 --> 00:28:03,220
You may go home and have a rest.

288
00:28:03,220 --> 00:28:04,600
Okay.

289
00:28:21,180 --> 00:28:22,600
Miao Jing.

290
00:28:22,600 --> 00:28:25,380
Go home and get some rest.
I'll have Bo come keep me company.

291
00:28:25,380 --> 00:28:27,940
The doctor said not to move around.

292
00:28:29,140 --> 00:28:30,960
What are you talking about?

293
00:28:31,779 --> 00:28:34,400
I said I'll have Bo come stay with me.
You should go home.

294
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:36,720
I'm not hungry yet.

295
00:28:37,220 --> 00:28:38,860
Miao Jing.

296
00:28:39,660 --> 00:28:41,700
Be good.

297
00:28:41,700 --> 00:28:44,200
If you're thirsty, have some water.

298
00:28:49,414 --> 00:28:52,720
I can run and jump. I really don't need this.

299
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:28,600
- Hello, ma'am.
- You're here.

300
00:29:37,759 --> 00:29:39,099
Excuse me.

301
00:29:39,099 --> 00:29:40,480
Where's the patient in this bed?

302
00:29:40,480 --> 00:29:43,240
I didn't notice. Maybe he stepped out?

303
00:29:52,340 --> 00:29:54,766
What are you doing, Miao Jing?

304
00:29:54,766 --> 00:29:56,420
I can't even use the bathroom alone?

305
00:29:56,420 --> 00:29:58,900
I thought you ran off.

306
00:30:02,359 --> 00:30:04,480
Where could a half-cripple like me go?

307
00:30:04,480 --> 00:30:06,840
You vanished without a word back then.

308
00:30:06,840 --> 00:30:09,320
How do I know you won't do it again?

309
00:30:12,665 --> 00:30:16,360
Fine. After I use the bathroom,
you can put me in your pocket.

310
00:30:21,400 --> 00:30:22,600
Get out. You can't stay here.

311
00:30:22,600 --> 00:30:24,300
- If you stay here, I--
- I won't.

312
00:30:24,300 --> 00:30:26,300
I'll stay with you.

313
00:30:27,220 --> 00:30:29,340
With you here, I can't pee.

314
00:30:30,760 --> 00:30:32,560
Close the door.

315
00:30:36,034 --> 00:30:37,635
You're not closing it?

316
00:30:38,359 --> 00:30:39,800
Fine.

317
00:30:42,960 --> 00:30:45,660
I'll wait outside. Hurry up.

318
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:16,341
You fell asleep.

319
00:31:19,940 --> 00:31:22,180
Your blanket wasn't covering you.

320
00:31:26,040 --> 00:31:27,880
Miao Jing.

321
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:30,940
Are you here to bother me or keep me company?

322
00:31:44,800 --> 00:31:47,220
- What?
- Come sleep on the bed.

323
00:31:50,700 --> 00:31:54,400
That medicine the doctor gave you works well.

324
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:56,700
You're healing fast.

325
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:07,300
I mean, you sleep in the big bed.
I'll take the small one.

326
00:32:07,300 --> 00:32:10,320
You've been running yourself ragged for days.
You need a real rest.

327
00:32:10,320 --> 00:32:11,880
Come here.

328
00:32:13,259 --> 00:32:15,340
Then let's sleep together.

329
00:32:51,120 --> 00:32:52,780
Are you asleep?

330
00:32:55,560 --> 00:32:57,520
No.

331
00:32:57,520 --> 00:32:59,680
I'm thinking.

332
00:33:03,077 --> 00:33:04,757
About what?

333
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:14,480
I was thinking
when you'll stop keeping me at arm's length.

334
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:18,560
You'd rather bother Bo than ask me for help.

335
00:33:24,599 --> 00:33:27,400
It's not that I'm keeping you
at arm's length. I just...

336
00:33:33,260 --> 00:33:38,520
I don't want my girlfriend doing all this,
like it's her job.

337
00:33:51,240 --> 00:33:52,921
Chen Yi.

338
00:33:54,620 --> 00:33:57,740
We're going to be together for a long time.

339
00:33:57,740 --> 00:34:02,900
When we're old,
I'll be leaning on you like this, too.

340
00:34:02,900 --> 00:34:05,500
And you'll be leaning on me.

341
00:34:19,100 --> 00:34:21,160
We're family.

342
00:34:43,460 --> 00:34:49,920
[Teng City First People's Hospital]

343
00:34:49,920 --> 00:34:51,360
Don't come all the way over.

344
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:53,679
Don't you still have a lot to do
at the pool hall?

345
00:34:53,679 --> 00:34:55,520
- Happy Mid-Autumn Festival.
- My arm is almost healed.

346
00:34:55,520 --> 00:34:56,880
No need to come.

347
00:34:56,880 --> 00:34:58,820
Get well soon.

348
00:34:59,760 --> 00:35:01,540
- Here's a Mid-Autumn Festival gift.
- Okay, I'm hanging up now.

349
00:35:01,540 --> 00:35:03,579
You're getting discharged today.
Make sure to get plenty of rest.

350
00:35:03,579 --> 00:35:05,020
- Don't overexert yourself.
- Okay.

351
00:35:05,020 --> 00:35:07,080
- Thank you.
- Here. Happy Mid-Autumn Festival.

352
00:35:17,142 --> 00:35:19,002
Everything's taken care of.

353
00:35:24,906 --> 00:35:26,586
What?

354
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:35,981
Let's go home.

355
00:36:12,239 --> 00:36:14,520
Miao Jing, bring me a piece of cardboard.

356
00:36:14,520 --> 00:36:17,681
- What?
- A piece of cardboard.

357
00:36:21,719 --> 00:36:23,840
That's all there is.

358
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:25,380
Fine.

359
00:36:26,660 --> 00:36:28,820
That looks awful.

360
00:36:35,748 --> 00:36:37,260
You're throwing the cigarettes away?

361
00:36:37,260 --> 00:36:40,079
They got damp.
I haven't smoked since I got back.

362
00:36:40,079 --> 00:36:42,000
You're behaving quite well.

363
00:36:52,100 --> 00:36:54,361
That's a huge mooncake.

364
00:36:56,120 --> 00:36:57,719
After the offering, we'll eat it.

365
00:36:57,719 --> 00:37:00,059
We can't finish it.

366
00:37:00,059 --> 00:37:01,560
With you here, we can.

367
00:37:01,560 --> 00:37:03,940
Do I really eat that much?

368
00:37:23,960 --> 00:37:26,260
What did you wish for? You took so long.

369
00:37:26,260 --> 00:37:28,039
Just one wish.

370
00:37:28,039 --> 00:37:29,660
What is it?

371
00:37:31,300 --> 00:37:33,099
If I say it, it won't come true.

372
00:37:33,099 --> 00:37:35,220
So stingy.

373
00:38:05,700 --> 00:38:08,400
I haven't seen you wear that earring in ages.

374
00:38:09,956 --> 00:38:11,440
Does it look good?

375
00:38:12,780 --> 00:38:15,060
It goes perfectly with your necklace.

376
00:38:16,480 --> 00:38:18,141
You like it?

377
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:28,460
It's pretty.

378
00:38:29,880 --> 00:38:31,920
Then...

379
00:38:31,920 --> 00:38:37,140
If you tell me what you wished for just now,
I'll wear this earring when I kiss you.

380
00:38:41,970 --> 00:38:43,519
I want...

381
00:38:43,519 --> 00:38:45,200
Want what?

382
00:38:49,519 --> 00:38:52,460
To always be by your side.

383
00:40:04,260 --> 00:40:06,180
Does it still hurt?

384
00:40:07,876 --> 00:40:09,780
It stopped hurting a long time ago.

385
00:40:19,840 --> 00:40:22,700
Before I arrived in Country Jin,

386
00:40:22,700 --> 00:40:25,340
Zhai Feng Mao tied me up at the docks.

387
00:40:26,179 --> 00:40:27,980
Honestly,

388
00:40:28,599 --> 00:40:30,820
I wasn't that scared back then.

389
00:40:32,699 --> 00:40:34,760
I was just thinking...

390
00:40:37,088 --> 00:40:39,469
I hadn't said goodbye to you properly.

391
00:40:41,143 --> 00:40:46,441
I hadn't held your hand properly, like this.

392
00:41:02,300 --> 00:41:03,980
Chen Yi.

393
00:41:05,540 --> 00:41:07,521
You're mine.

394
00:42:06,540 --> 00:42:08,360
Morning.

395
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:09,800
Morning.

396
00:42:11,260 --> 00:42:13,540
Breakfast is on the table.

397
00:42:21,860 --> 00:42:23,680
What are you doing?

398
00:42:23,680 --> 00:42:27,040
I hadn't even had a chance to talk to you,
and you woke up.

399
00:42:28,320 --> 00:42:29,780
So?

400
00:42:29,780 --> 00:42:31,420
Nothing.

401
00:42:38,500 --> 00:42:40,640
It's scratchy.

402
00:42:41,159 --> 00:42:44,320
- I haven't shaved.
- Then shave.

403
00:42:45,940 --> 00:42:47,520
Move.

404
00:42:56,720 --> 00:42:58,120
I'll do it.

405
00:42:58,920 --> 00:43:01,260
Do you even know how?

406
00:43:11,860 --> 00:43:13,420
Like this.

407
00:43:16,400 --> 00:43:18,020
Easy.

408
00:43:18,020 --> 00:43:19,740
Lower.

409
00:43:24,060 --> 00:43:26,041
Don't move.

410
00:43:30,180 --> 00:43:32,160
Go a little lower.

411
00:43:32,886 --> 00:43:35,166
Or the angle won't work.

412
00:43:44,980 --> 00:43:46,960
A little lower.

413
00:43:48,239 --> 00:43:49,920
What are you doing?

414
00:43:56,000 --> 00:43:58,300
Is this low enough?

415
00:43:58,300 --> 00:43:59,940
Good.

416
00:44:02,500 --> 00:44:04,500
Listen.

417
00:44:04,500 --> 00:44:08,540
What happened this time
was definitely no accident.

418
00:44:08,540 --> 00:44:14,160
They really shifted everyone's focus
to the arson case.

419
00:44:17,720 --> 00:44:20,800
I thought you were about to say
something sweet to me.

420
00:44:22,039 --> 00:44:25,099
If they're this anxious,
they'll slip up sooner or later.

421
00:44:25,099 --> 00:44:30,400
So we just wait and see.

422
00:44:30,400 --> 00:44:32,620
But I won't let anything happen to you.

423
00:44:34,340 --> 00:44:36,200
With that tiny frame of yours?

424
00:44:36,200 --> 00:44:38,920
Then starting tomorrow,
we'll work out together.

425
00:44:40,200 --> 00:44:41,640
Okay.

